  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="28">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 28</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ac haligdom and hadas and gehalgode Godes hus a man sceal for Godes ege weorðian georne, and inwerdre heortan æfre God lufian.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">But holiness and the holy orders and the hallowed house of God shall always be fervently venerated for fear of God, and God always be loved with one’s innermost heart.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ac haligdom 7 hadas 7 gehalgode Godes hus a man sceal for Godes ege weorðian georne 7 inwerdre heortan æfre God lufian.</ab>
      </div>
